---
title: APIM (DB-less)
endpoints:
  # DB-less runs the gateway alone -- the console, portal and management
  # API inherited from apim/base are switched off.
  - name: APIM Console
    when: false
  - name: APIM Portal
    when: false
  - name: APIM API
    when: false
  # The gateway is reduced to a single plaintext server, so the base's TLS
  # port has nothing listening behind it.
  - name: APIM Gateway (TLS)
    when: false
---
The gateway is configured from Kubernetes resources only. Create Gravitee CRDs
with GKO to publish APIs.
